"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 現在、「トリプルトライアド」の大会……<br>「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>」を開催中です！<br>目玉賞品はなんと、「<sheet Item $n1 0>」！
#. de: Hast du Lust, dein Glück und Können in einem Kartenturnier auf die Probe zu stellen? Das aktuelle Turnier heißt „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>“ und als Preis winkt <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 1 1>!
#. fr: <capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0></capitalize> se déroule ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment au squarrre des duellistes<nbsp>! Qui seront les heureux gagnants d'<noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>? Le suspense est à son comble<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_000_001:1"
msgid "Hello, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>! <capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0></capitalize> is currently underway! Place in the top three, and you'll take home <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr "Здравствуйте, <if $gn4>мисс<else>сэр</if>! Сейчас проходит турнир «<capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0></capitalize>». Войдите в тройку лидеров и получите <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"

#. ja: こちらは、「トリプルトライアド」の大会受付窓口です。<br>……お客様はまだ、対戦のルールをご存じないようですね。
#. de: Willkommen am Turnier-Schalter, mein Gold<if $gn4>stückchen<else>junge</if>! Wenn ich mich nicht täusche, bist du zum ersten Mal hier, habe ich Recht? Ich vergesse nämlich nie ein Gesicht, und schon gar nicht so ein markantes wie deins.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>rr<nbsp>! Vous êtes <if $gn4>nouvelle<else>nouveau</if> par ici, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>? Vous avez frappé à la bonne porte<nbsp>! En effet, je suis chargée des ex<shy>pli<shy>ca<shy>tions concernant les tournois de Triple Triade.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_000_002:1"
msgid "Hello, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>! Looking to enter a Triple Triad tournament? I...oh. I'm afraid our records show that you've yet to take the required tutorial."
msgstr "Здравствуйте, <if $gn4>мисс<else>сэр</if>! Хотите записаться на турнир по тройной триаде? Я... Ой. Боюсь, по нашим записям вы ещё не прошли обязательное обучение."

#. ja: 大会にご参加いただくためにも、<br>まずは、「トリプルトライアドマスター」から、<br>対戦の手ほどきを受けてはいかがでしょうか？
#. de: Dann möchte ich dich bitten, erst einmal mit der Triple Triad-Meisterin zu sprechen. Sie wird dir alles erklären, was du über den Ablauf der Turniere wissen musst.
#. fr: Mais j'y pense... Peut-être devriez-vous vous mesurer à la croupière du guichet principal pour mettre en pratique les rrrègles de base<nbsp>? Ça vous sera cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment utile si vous voulez participer aux tournois<nbsp>! Le guichet est juste en bas de l'escalier, vous ne pouvez pas le rater<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_000_003:1"
msgid "If you'd like to participate in tournaments, please speak with the Triple Triad master and she will gladly walk you through the basic rules of the game!"
msgstr "Если хотите участвовать в турнирах, поговорите с мастером тройной триады. Она с радостью объяснит вам основные правила игры!"

#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du machen?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_Q1_000_001:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что будете делать?"

#. ja: 大会にエントリーする
#. de: An einem Turnier teilnehmen.
#. fr: S'inscrire au tournoi
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Enter the current tournament."
msgstr "Записаться на текущий турнир"

#. ja: 現在のランキングを見る
#. de: Die aktuelle Rangliste einsehen.
#. fr: Voir le classement
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "View current tournament rankings."
msgstr "Посмотреть текущий рейтинг"

#. ja: ランキングの確認方法を聞く
#. de: Mehr über die Rangliste erfahren.
#. fr: Demander comment vérifier le classement
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A1_000_006:1"
msgid "Ask about tournament rankings."
msgstr "Спросить о рейтинге турнира"

#. ja: 大会の賞品を聞く
#. de: Etwas über die Preise erfahren.
#. fr: En savoir plus sur les récompenses
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A1_000_003:1"
msgid "Ask about tournament prizes."
msgstr "Спросить о призах турнира"

#. ja: 大会について説明を聞く
#. de: Mir die Turniere erklären lassen.
#. fr: En savoir plus sur les tournois
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A1_000_004:1"
msgid "Ask about tournament rules."
msgstr "Спросить о правилах турнира"

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A1_000_005:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Ничего."

#. ja: 「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>」に、<br>エントリーいたしますか？
#. de: Möchtest du an diesem Kartenturnier teilnehmen: „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>“?
#. fr: Voulez-vous vous inscrire au tourrrnoi “<capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0></capitalize>”<nbsp>?
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_010_001:1"
msgid "Shall I sign you up for <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>?"
msgstr "Записать вас на турнир «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>»?"

#. ja: 「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>」にエントリーする？
#. de: Wirklich an diesem Turnier teilnehmen: „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>“?
#. fr: S'inscrire au tournoi “<capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0></capitalize>”<nbsp>?
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_Q2_000_001:1"
msgid "Enter <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>?"
msgstr "Участвовать в турнире «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>»?"

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A2_000_001:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A2_000_002:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Нет"

#. ja: では、<string $gs1>さんを、<br>「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>」に参加登録しました。<br>入賞目指して、がんばってくださいね！
#. de: Gut, ich habe deinen Namen auf der Teilnehmerliste eingetragen. Möge Nymeia dir hold sein!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Chèrrre<else>Cherrr</if> <string $gs1>, votre inscription a été validée<nbsp>! Bonne chance à vous<nbsp>!
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_011_001:1"
msgid "There we are, <string $gs1>! You are now officially registered for <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>. Best of luck in the tournament!"
msgstr "Готово, <string $gs1>! Вы зарегистрированы на турнир «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>». Удачи!"

#. ja: 「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>」の開催期間は、<br>（地球時間）<set-time $n2><num $year>年<num $month>月<num $day>日（<switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>） <if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時から、<br><set-time $n3><num $year>年<num $month>月<num $day>日（<switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>） <if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時までです。
#. de: Das nächste Turnier ist „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>“ und findet vom <set-time $n2><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> (<switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch>) um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr bis zum <set-time $n3><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> (<switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch>) um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr statt.
#. fr: <capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0></capitalize> se déroulera du <set-time $n2><switch $weekday><case>dimanche<case>lundi<case>mardi<case>mercredi<case>jeudi<case>vendredi<case>samedi</switch> <num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h au <set-time $n3><switch $weekday><case>dimanche<case>lundi<case>mardi<case>mercredi<case>jeudi<case>vendredi<case>samedi</switch> <num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <set-time $n2> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 77 == 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $day> — a number; value = day of the month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = day of the week of the set time, 1 for Sunday (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <set-time $n3> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_011_002:1"
msgid "Matches for <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> will be held from <set-time $n2><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> - <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (<switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch>) to <set-time $n3><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> - <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (<switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch>)."
msgstr "Матчи турнира «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>» будут проходить с <set-time $n2><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year></if>, <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>PM<else>AM</if> (<switch $weekday><case>воскресенье<case>понедельник<case>вторник<case>среда<case>четверг<case>пятница<case>суббота</switch>) до <set-time $n3><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year></if>, <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>PM<else>AM</if> (<switch $weekday><case>воскресенье<case>понедельник<case>вторник<case>среда<case>четверг<case>пятница<case>суббота</switch>)."

#. ja: 大会対戦は、「カードバトルルーム」内でのみ行えます。<br>ルーム内の「トリプルトライアドアシスタント」から、<br>「参加登録（大会対戦）」を選んで対戦してください。
#. de: Nur Partien, die im Weltensalon gespielt werden, werden als Turnierpartien gezählt. Sprich dort mit einem Salon-Häschen, um dir einen Turnierpartner vermitteln zu lassen.
#. fr: Les duels de tournoi ne peuvent être joués que dans l'arène Triple Triade. Pour cela veuillez vous adresser sur place à l'une des assistantes du croupier.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_011_103:1"
msgid "Looking to test your skills against a full field of worthy opponents? Head to the Triple Triad Battlehall and sign up for a tournament! It is as simple as speaking to one of the hall attendants, and stating your desire to enter."
msgstr "Хотите проверить свои силы против достойных соперников? Тогда отправляйтесь в Зал карточных баталий и запишитесь на турнир! Просто скажите одному из помощников зала, что хотите участвовать."

#. ja: なお、大会対戦を一度でも行った場合、<br>ランキングを集計するために、退出先が、<br>ゴールドソーサーの「カードスクウェア」になります。
#. de: Um in die Turnierwertung aufgenommen zu werden, reicht es, eine Partie zu spielen. Verlasse den Weltensalon und sieh dir die Wertung im Kartenspiel-Salon an.
#. fr: Si vous sortez de l'arène après avoir joué au moins un match de tournoi, vous vous retrouverez au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment au square des duellistes du Gold Saucer, ce afin de permettre de comptabiliser le résultat dans le classement.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_011_004:1"
msgid "Note that after participating in a tournament, you will be escorted back to Card Square while your ranking is tabulated."
msgstr "После участия в турнире вас перенесут на Площадь карт, пока подсчитывают результаты."

#. ja: また、大会終了時間の（地球時間）15分前となった場合も、<br>ゴールドソーサーへ強制退出となりますのでご注意ください。
#. de: 15 Minuten vor Turnierende wirst du automatisch aus dem Weltensalon entfernt und zum Kartenspiel-Salon befördert.
#. fr: Vous serez également conduit<if $gn4>e</if> systématiquement au Gold Saucer dès lors qu'il ne restera plus que 15 minutes (temps réel) avant la fin du tournoi en cours.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_011_005:1"
msgid "Furthermore, you will also be escorted out of the Battlehall once it reaches fifteen minutes before the end of the tournament period."
msgstr "Кроме того, за 15 минут до окончания турнира вас выведут из Зала карточных баталий."

#. ja: 大会が終了して、（地球時間）1週間が経過すると、<br>次の大会がはじまり、賞品が受け取れなくなります。<br>大会終了後は、忘れずに「大会受付窓口」に話しかけましょう。
#. de: Vergiss nicht, deinen Preis entgegenzunehmen! Er wird nur eine Woche (Erdenzeit) für dich aufgehoben und kann danach nicht mehr abgeholt werden.
#. fr: Le tournoi suivant commence une semaine après la fin du tournoi en cours (temps réel). Pour ne pas perdre définitivement votre récompense, veillez à la récupérer avant la fin de ce délai.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_011_003:1"
msgid "Once the competition is over, speak with the tournament recordkeeper as soon as possible to claim your winnings. A new competition will begin one week after the current tournament ends, and all unclaimed prizes will be forfeit at this time."
msgstr "Когда турнир закончится, как можно скорее поговорите с распорядителем турнира и заберите приз. Через неделю после завершения начнётся новый турнир, а все невостребованные награды пропадут."

#. ja: 「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>」の、<br>現在のランキングは、このようになっております。
#. de: Dich interessiert also, was die Konkurrenz macht? Daran erkennt man die echten Profis ... Hier, die aktuelle Rangliste für das Turnier „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>“.
#. fr: Voici le classement prrrovisoire du tournoi en cours.
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_020_001:1"
msgid "These are the current rankings for <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>."
msgstr "Текущий рейтинг турнира «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>» выглядит так."

#. ja: お客様のランキングは、<br>ゴールドソーサーの「カードスクウェア」に設置された、<br>「ランキングボード」からご確認いただけます！
#. de: Die Turnierwertung kann auf der Ranglistentafel im Kartenspiel-Salon eingesehen werden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez vérifier la place que vous occupez à tout moment en consultant le tableau des classements situé au square des duellistes.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_020_002:1"
msgid "If you are curious where you stand in the ever-heated struggle for first place, you can check your current ranking at any time simply by observing the ranking board in Card Square."
msgstr "Хотите узнать, какое место занимаете в этой борьбе за первое место? Проверить свой рейтинг можно в любое время на доске рейтингов на Площади карт."

#. ja: 大会の賞品は、<br>「星神ニメーヤ賞典」や「オーラン記念」など、<br>開催しているタイトルによって、内容が異なります。
#. de: Ein Turnier zu gewinnen, ist nicht nur Ehrensache. Jedes Turnier lockt mit eigenen Preisen zur Teilnahme.
#. fr: Les récompenses diffèrent selon le tourrrnoi organisé.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_000:1"
msgid "Tournament prizes vary from contest to contest, so different winnings will be earned from the Spinner's Pull as opposed to, say, the Durai Memorial."
msgstr "Призы зависят от турнира: например, в «Приливном проходе» они одни, а в «Мемориале Дюрая» — другие."

#. ja: 「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>」の、<br>1位から3位に入賞した方には、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」が贈られます！
#. de: Die Plätze 1 bis 3 des aktuellen Turniers „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>“ werden mit <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 3 1> belohnt.
#. fr: En ce qui concerne <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>, les laurrréats de la première à la troisième place gagnent <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_001:1"
msgid "Entrants who claim first, second, or third place in <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0> will be awarded <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr "Участники, занявшие первые три места в турнире «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>», получат <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"

#. ja: また、副賞として、順位に応じたMGPも獲得できます！<br>今回手に入るのは、最高で<kilo $n1 ",">MGP！
#. de: Zusätzlich erhalten diese Top-Spieler abhängig von ihrem Platz Manderville Gold Saucer-Punkte, wobei der erste Platz den Hauptgewinn von <kilo $n1 "."> MGP mit nach Hause nehmen kann!
#. fr: Et ce n'est pas tout<nbsp>! Chaque joueurrr reçoit également un certain nombre de points du Gold Saucer, ou “PGS”, en fonction de sa position dans le classement. Cette fois-ci, le maximum pouvant être obtenu est de <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> PGS<nbsp>!
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_101:1"
msgid "These top-ranking players will also be awarded a number of MGP, with first place earning a grand prize of <kilo $n1 \",\"> points!"
msgstr "Лидеры рейтинга также получат МГП. За первое место полагается целых <kilo $n1 \",\"> очков!"

#. ja: 4位から6位までの方には、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」と、<br>順位に応じたMGPを差し上げます。
#. de: Die Plätze 4 bis 6 erhalten <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> und, abhängig von ihrem Rang, Manderville Gold Saucer-Punkte.
#. fr: Les par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants de la quatrième à la sixième place repartent avec <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> ainsi qu'avec le nombre de PGS correspondant à leur rang.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_002:1"
msgid "Entrants who place from fourth to sixth in the rankings will be awarded <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>, as well as a number of MGP dependent on their rank."
msgstr "Занявшие места с четвёртого по шестое получат <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>, а также МГП в зависимости от занятого места."

#. ja: 7位から10位までの方には、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」と、<br>おなじく、順位に応じたMGPを差し上げます。
#. de: Die Plätze 7 bis 10 erhalten <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> und, abhängig von ihrem Rang, Manderville Gold Saucer-Punkte.
#. fr: Les joueurrrs qui se seront positionnés entre les septième et dixième places se verront récompensés avec <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> en plus d'un montant de PGS dépendant de leur classement.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_007:1"
msgid "Entrants who place from seventh to tenth will be awarded <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>, as well as─again─a number of MGP based upon their rank."
msgstr "Занявшие места с седьмого по десятое получат <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>, а также, как и остальные, МГП в зависимости от занятого места."

#. ja: そして、11位から20位までの方には、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」と、<br>やはり、順位に応じたMGPを差し上げます。
#. de: Plätze 11 bis 20 erhalten <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> und, abhängig von ihrem Rang, Manderville Gold Saucer-Punkte.
#. fr: Quant à ceux ayant terminé entre la onzième et la vingtième position, ils auront droit à <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> et, vous l'aurez deviné, des PGS<nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_003:1"
msgid "Those who rank eleventh through twentieth will be awarded <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>, as well as─stop me if you've heard this one─a set amount of MGP based upon their rank."
msgstr "Занявшие места с одиннадцатого по двадцатое получат <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> и, думаю, вы уже догадались, МГП в зависимости от места."

#. ja: 惜しくも入賞を逃した方には、<br>参加賞として、<kilo $n1 ",">MGPが贈られます。
#. de: Teilnehmer, die es nicht unter die ersten Zwanzig schaffen, erhalten für ihre Teilnahme <kilo $n1 "."> MGP, was auch nicht zu verachten ist.
#. fr: Même ceux qui ne sont pas parvenus à se faire une place parmi les vingt premiers repartent tout de même avec <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> PGS<nbsp>!
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_004:1"
msgid "Lastly, those who fail to place in the top twenty will receive a participation gift of <kilo $n1 \",\"> MGP."
msgstr "Те, кто не войдёт в первую двадцатку, получат утешительный приз за участие — <kilo $n1 \",\"> МГП."

#. ja: なお、これらのMGPには、<br>大会終了時に獲得していた「勝ち点」に応じて、<br>ボーナスが付与されます！
#. de: Abhängig von ihrem Punktestand am Ende des Turniers wird allen Teilnehmern auf ihren MGP-Preis sogar noch ein Bonus addiert.
#. fr: De plus, sachez que vous pourrez même obtenirrr un bonus de PGS déterminé en fonction de votre score final<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_005:1"
msgid "In addition to these rewards, entrants will receive a bonus amount of MGP based on the number of points they have earned at the conclusion of the tournament."
msgstr "Кроме этих наград, участники получат бонусные МГП. Их количество зависит от набранных к концу турнира очков."

#. ja: さらに、同じく「勝ち点」に応じた、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」も差し上げておりますので、<br>ぜひ、奮ってご参加ください！
#. de: Das war noch nicht alles: Teilnehmer, die genug Punkte erzielen, bekommen vielleicht sogar noch <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> als Belohnung obendrauf! Es lohnt sich also auf jeden Fall!
#. fr: Et ce n'est pas tout car en plus de ce bonus, il y a également <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> à la clef<nbsp>! Vous voyez, il n'y a vraiment aucune rrraison de ne pas participer<nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_030_006:1"
msgid "Entrants who earn enough points will also be awarded a bonus <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1>, so get that tournament score as high as you can!"
msgstr "А набравшие достаточно очков получат ещё и бонусный <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1>. Так что постарайтесь набрать как можно больше очков!"

#. ja: ゴールドソーサーでは、大人気競技である、<br>「トリプルトライアド」の大会を開催しております！
#. de: Triple Triad ist eins unserer beliebtesten Spiele hier im Gold Saucer. Und um herauszufinden, wer der größte Glückspilz und die abgebrühteste Zockerin weit und breit ist, halten wir regelmäßige Turniere ab.
#. fr: Au Gold Saucer, nous organisons ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment des événements que tous les duellistes en herbe attendent, j'ai nommé les tourrrnois de Triple Triade<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_001:1"
msgid "Triple Triad tournaments are some of the most enthralling and popular events to be held at the Manderville Gold Saucer!"
msgstr "Турниры по тройной триаде — одни из самых захватывающих и популярных развлечений в Золотом блюдце Мандервиля!"

#. ja: 大会にエントリーすると、<br>冒険者さん同士で「勝ち点」を競いあう、<br>ランキング形式の「大会対戦」が行えます。
#. de: Wir führen eine Rangliste, die im Laufe des Turniers Auskunft über die aktuellen Punktzahlen gibt. So kann jeder sehen, wo er steht und welche Aussichten er auf den Sieg hat.
#. fr: Le but des par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants de chaque tournoi est d'obtenir le meilleur score possible afin de se hisser dans les hautes sphères du classement.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_002:1"
msgid "Once you've entered a tournament, you will be able to play tournament matches against your fellow adventurers in a battle to become the top-ranked player."
msgstr "Записавшись на турнир, вы сможете сразиться с другими искателями приключений и побороться за первое место в рейтинге."

#. ja: 大会には、冒険者の方々以外にも、<br>「カードバトルルーム」にいる腕自慢の者たちも参加しますよ！
#. de: Neben den vielen Abenteurern, die ihre Kräfte zur Abwechslung im Kartenspiel messen, nehmen auch die geübten Spieler im Weltensalon teil.
#. fr: C'est également l'occasion pour nos meilleurs joueurs, présents dans l'arène Triple Triade, de donner du fil à retorrrdre aux aventuriers... Évaluez bien le moindre de vos coups lorsque vous les affronterez<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_003:1"
msgid "But it won't be easy─the Gold Saucer's champions found here in the Triple Triad Battlehall will also take part in the competition!"
msgstr "Но победа достанется не легко: чемпионы Золотого блюдца, которых вы найдёте в Зале карточных баталий, тоже примут участие в турнире!"

#. ja: なお、「大会対戦」の際は、<br>対戦ルールが大会専用のもので固定されますので、<br>ご注意ください！
#. de: Im Turnier gelten bestimmte Match-Regeln, über die du dich unbedingt informieren solltest. Sie können schnell über Sieg und Niederlage entscheiden.
#. fr: Attention aux différentes règles, cependant<nbsp>! Eh oui, elles changent en fonction des tournois. Veillez à bien les rrréviser avant de participer à l'un d'entre eux, d'accord<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_004:1"
msgid "You should also know that each tournament title has a fixed set of advanced rules that tournament matches must follow!"
msgstr "Учтите: для каждого турнира установлены свои особые правила, и матчи проходят только по ним!"

#. ja: 「大会対戦」を行うことで、「勝ち点」が獲得できます。<br>対戦で勝利すれば、「勝ち点」を多く入手できます！
#. de: In jeder Partie erzielt man Punkte - für Siege natürlich mehr als für Niederlagen.
#. fr: Comme dans n'importe quel événement de ce genre, le classement est défini selon le score total des par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants. Chaque duel remporté apporte évidemment son lot de points.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_005:1"
msgid "Every tournament match you play will count towards your final score. This score will increase for every match you win."
msgstr "Каждый матч влияет на итоговый счёт. За победу вы получите больше очков."

#. ja: 大会ごとに、対戦が行える回数は決まっております。<br>その対戦回数の中で、<br>より多くの「勝ち点」を獲得できるようがんばりましょう！
#. de: Die Anzahl der Matches pro Turnier ist festgelegt. Es geht also darum, in einer bestimmten Anzahl von Partien möglichst viele Punkte zu gewinnen.
#. fr: Les matches classés de chaque tournoi étant en nombre limité, votre but sera d'en remporrrter un maximum afin d'accumuler le plus grand nombre de points possible.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_006:1"
msgid "Oh, and you can only play a set number of matches per tournament, so be sure to make every battle count!"
msgstr "В каждом турнире можно сыграть лишь ограниченное число матчей. Постарайтесь набрать как можно больше очков за эти игры!"

#. ja: 開催している大会の、現在の順位は、<br><if ($n1 == 0)>私にお尋ねいただくか、お隣のランキングボードをご確認ください。<else>ゴールドソーサーのカードスクウェアに設置された<br>ランキングボードをご確認ください。</if>
#. de: Die aktuelle Rangliste für das laufende Turnier kannst du dir <if ($n1 == 0)>bei mir oder dort an der Ranglistentafel<else>an der Ranglistentafel im Kartenspiel-Salon</if> ansehen.
#. fr: Pour connaître le classement du tournoi en cours, <if ($n1 == 0)>vous pouvez vous adresser à moi ou tout simplement consulter le tableau à ma droite<else>consultez le tableau au square des duellistes</if>.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 0)>I will be happy to provide you with the current rankings at any time during the tournament. The board here beside me will also display the ongoin… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_007:1"
msgid "<if ($n1 == 0)>I will be happy to provide you with the current rankings at any time during the tournament. The board here beside me will also display the ongoing struggle for first place!<else>You may check where you stand at any time by observing the ranking board in Card Square.</if>"
msgstr "<if ($n1 == 0)>Я в любой момент могу показать вам текущий рейтинг. А доска рядом со мной всегда отображает борьбу за первое место!<else>Проверить своё место в рейтинге можно в любое время на доске на Площади карт.</if>"

#. ja: 開催期間が終了しますと、<br>獲得した「勝ち点」によって順位が決まります。
#. de: Dort kannst du nach Ablauf des Turniers auch den Endstand ablesen.
#. fr: Quant au classement définitif, il est déterrrminé selon le score total des par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants à la fin de chaque tournoi.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_008:1"
msgid "Scores will be locked the moment the tournament ends, and these numbers will determine your final ranking."
msgstr "Как только турнир завершится, результаты зафиксируют и по ним определят итоговый рейтинг."

#. ja: 上位の方には、特別なカードが贈られますので、<br>大会に参加されるときは、<br>ぜひ、上位入賞を目指してくださいね！
#. de: Mach mit und du hast die Chance, eine seltene Karte zu gewinnen!
#. fr: Si vous parvenez à vous hisser dans les premières places à ce moment-là, vous gagnerez une carrrte spéciale qui vous aidera à remporter encore plus de parties<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_009:1"
msgid "Aim to place in the top three and you might just win yourself a rare card!"
msgstr "Постарайтесь войти в тройку лидеров — и, возможно, выиграете редкую карту!"

#. ja: なお、参加された方には、獲得した「勝ち点」に応じたMGPと、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を、<br>ボーナスとして差し上げております！
#. de: Alle Teilnehmer erhalten ja nach Abschneiden Manderville-Goldsaucer-Punkte und vielleicht sogar <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> als Bonus obendrauf!
#. fr: De plus, sachez que vous pourrez même obtenirrr un bonus de PGS déterminé en fonction de votre score final, ainsi qu'<noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_010:1"
msgid "Participants will be awarded bonus MGP and bonus <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> based on the number of tournament points they have earned."
msgstr "Участники также получат бонусные МГП и бонусные <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> в зависимости от набранных очков."

#. ja: 「勝ち点」を多く獲得するほど、<br>得られるボーナスが増えていきますので、<br>最後まで、がんばって戦い抜きましょう！
#. de: Je mehr Punkte, desto besser die Preise, also gib nicht vorschnell auf.
#. fr: Plus vous aurez de points à la fin du tournoi, plus votre bonus de PGS sera élevé alors battez-vous comme <if $gn4>une lionne<else>un lion</if> jusqu'au bout<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_040_011:1"
msgid "The more points you earn, the better the bonus you receive, so try to push your score as high as possible before the tournament comes to a close!"
msgstr "Чем больше очков вы наберёте, тем щедрее будет бонус. Так что сражайтесь до конца и постарайтесь набрать побольше!"

#. ja: 最終順位が決定される際に、<br>獲得した「勝ち点」が同じ参加者がいた場合は、<br>勝利数の多い方が上位となります。
#. de: Bei gleicher Punktzahl erhält der Spieler den höheren Rang, der mehr Siege vorzuweisen hat.
#. fr: En cas d'égalité lors du classement final, c'est le joueur ayant le plus de victoires qui l'emporte.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_140_006:1"
msgid "When two or more players share the same score at the end of a tournament, rank is then determined by the greatest number of wins."
msgstr "Если по итогам турнира у нескольких участников окажется одинаковое число очков, выше будет тот, кто одержал больше побед."

#. ja: 同じく、勝利数も等しい場合は、対戦数の少ない方が上位に。<br>対戦数も等しかった場合は、ランキングボードに、<br>名前が掲載された時刻が早い参加者が上位となります。
#. de: Ist auch die Anzahl der Siege gleich, erhält der Spieler den Vorrang, der die wenigsten Partien absolviert hat. Steht auch dann kein Sieger fest, entscheidet die Reihenfolge, in der sich die Spieler für das Turnier eingeschrieben haben.
#. fr: Si deux joueurs sont à égalité et ont le même nombre de victoires, c'est celui qui a joué le moins de matches qui obtient l'avantage, et si le nombre de matches est également le même, le rang supérieur revient au joueur qui s'est inscrit au tournoi le premier.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_240_006:1"
msgid "If wins are also equal, then rank will be decided by the least number of matches played. Should match numbers also be equal, then the higher rank will go to the participant who first recorded a result on the tournament ranking board."
msgstr "Если и побед окажется поровну, выше будет тот, кто сыграл меньше матчей. А если и матчей сыграно одинаково, победит участник, чьё имя раньше появилось в рейтинге."

#. ja: お疲れさまでした！<br>「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>」は終了しました。<br><split " " 2><string $gs1></split>さんの順位を確認しますね。
#. de: Das Turnier „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>“ ist beendet. Warte, ich sehe mal nach, welchen Rang du belegt hast.
#. fr: Et voilà, <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> s'achève<nbsp>! Laissez-moi vérrrifier votre rang dans le classement.
#. macro: <capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_100_001:1"
msgid "<capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0></capitalize> has come to a close! Let's have a look at the final rankings, shall we?"
msgstr "Турнир «<capitalize><sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0></capitalize>» завершился! Посмотрим итоговый рейтинг."

#. ja: おめでとうございます！<br><split " " 2><string $gs1></split>さんは、「第<kilo $n1 ",">位」でした！
#. de: Herzlichen Glückwunsch! Du hast den <kilo $n1 "">. Platz belegt.
#. fr: Vous êtes en <num $n1><if ($n1 <= 1)>ère<else>e</if> position<nbsp>! Toutes mes félicitations, <string $gs1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_110_001:1"
msgid "Congratulations, <string $gs1>! I see your name right there at number <kilo $n1 \",\">!"
msgstr "Поздравляю, <string $gs1>! Вижу ваше имя на <kilo $n1 \",\">-м месте!"

#. ja: 賞品の「<sheet Item $n1 0>」と、<br>「勝ち点」ボーナスを加えた、<br><kilo $n2 ",">MGPをお受け取りください！
#. de: Hier ist dein Preis: <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> und obendrauf noch <kilo $n2 "."> MGP als Punktebonus.
#. fr: Voici votre <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1> ainsi que vos <kilo $n2 "<nbsp>"> PGS, bonus compris<nbsp>! Faites en bon usage, surtout<nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <kilo $n2 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 2, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_110_002:1"
msgid "I am pleased to award you <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>! And after adding in your point bonus, your total prize winnings come to <kilo $n2 \",\"> MGP!"
msgstr "В награду получите <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>! А с бонусом за очки вам полагается целых <kilo $n2 \",\"> МГП!"

#. ja: 「勝ち点」ボーナスを加えた、<br><kilo $n1 ",">MGPをお受け取りください！
#. de: Hier ist dein Preisgeld: <kilo $n1 "."> MGP. Herzlichen Glückwunsch!
#. fr: Voici vos <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> PGS, bonus compris<nbsp>! Faites-en bon usage, surtout<nbsp>!
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_110_003:1"
msgid "With the addition of your point bonus, I am pleased to award you the sum of <kilo $n1 \",\"> MGP!"
msgstr "С учётом бонуса за очки вам полагается <kilo $n1 \",\"> МГП!"

#. ja: 加えて、<split " " 2><string $gs1></split>さんには、<br>こちらの「<sheet Item $n1 0>」もお贈りいたします。
#. de: Außerdem erhältst du als Bonus noch <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Oh, mais où ai-je la tête<nbsp>? Vous avez également gagné <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>! Voilà, c'est pourrr vous<nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_110_010:1"
msgid "Your impressive performance has also earned you <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr "За отличное выступление вам полагается <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"

#. ja: 賞品を受け取りますか？
#. de: Den Preis entgegennehmen?
#. fr: Voulez-vous récupérer votre récompense<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_Q3_000_001:1"
msgid "Accept your prize?"
msgstr "Получить приз?"

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A3_000_001:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A3_000_002:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Нет"

#. ja: 次回の大会も、ぜひご参加くださいね！
#. de: Ich wünsch dir viel Erfolg fürs nächste Turnier!
#. fr: Le prochain tournoi commencera trrrès bientôt, alors n'oubliez pas de revenir nous voir à ce moment-là<nbsp>! À bientôt<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_110_004:1"
msgid "Thank you for entering, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>, and I hope to see you return for our next Triple Triad tournament!"
msgstr "Спасибо за участие, <if $gn4>мисс<else>сэр</if>! Надеюсь, вы вернётесь и на следующий турнир по тройной триаде."

#. ja: 惜しくも<split " " 2><string $gs1></split>さんは、<br>今回、入賞には至りませんでした……。
#. de: Diesmal hat es leider nicht für einen der oberen Plätze gereicht.
#. fr: Oh, quel dommage... Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, vous ne faites pas parrrtie des vingt élus cette fois-ci.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_120_001:1"
msgid "...Ah, I'm afraid you didn't quite earn a winning rank this time around."
msgstr "...Ах, боюсь, на этот раз вам не удалось занять призовое место."

#. ja: それでは、「勝ち点」ボーナスを加えた、<br><kilo $n1 ",">MGPをお受け取りください。
#. de: Aber du hast dir trotzdem ein Preisgeld von <kilo $n1 "."> MGP verdient - inklusive Punktebonus!
#. fr: Voici quand même <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> points du Gold Saucer pour vous, bonus compris. Ne faites pas cette tête, vous ferez mieux la prrrochaine fois<nbsp>! Nous serons tous très heureux de vous revoir<nbsp>!
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_120_002:1"
msgid "You are, however, eligible to receive a participation gift of <kilo $n1 \",\"> MGP...which includes a bonus for your high tournament score!"
msgstr "Но вам всё равно полагается приз за участие — <kilo $n1 \",\"> МГП... включая бонус за высокий результат!"

#. ja: それでは、参加賞の、<br><kilo $n1 ",">MGPをお受け取りください。
#. de: Aber du hast dir trotzdem ein Preisgeld von <kilo $n1 "."> MGP verdient.
#. fr: Voici quand même <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> points du Gold Saucer pour vous, en guise de lot de consolation.
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_120_005:1"
msgid "You are, however, eligible to receive a participation gift of <kilo $n1 \",\"> MGP!"
msgstr "Но вам всё равно полагается приз за участие — <kilo $n1 \",\"> МГП!"

#. ja: 加えて、<split " " 2><string $gs1></split>さんには、<br>こちらの「<sheet Item $n1 0>」もお贈りいたします。
#. de: Weil du dich so wacker geschlagen hast, erhältst du obendrauf noch <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Oh, mais où ai-je la tête<nbsp>? Vous avez également gagné des <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1> en récompense<nbsp>! Voilà, c'est pourrr vous<nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_120_010:1"
msgid "Your impressive performance has also earned you <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr "За отличное выступление вам полагается <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>!"

#. ja: お疲れさまでした！<br>大会の結果は、ゴールドソーサーの「カードスクウェア」にて、<br>ご確認いただけます！
#. de: Wie war das Turnier? Wenn du dir das Endergebnis ansehen möchtest, besuch doch bitte den Kartenspiel-Salon.
#. fr: Merci d'avoir participé au tournoi<nbsp>! Pour en connaître le résultat, et notamment votre classement final, veuillez vous rendre au square des duellistes<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_130_001:1"
msgid "Congratulations on a hard-fought tourney! Should you wish to review the final standings, you may do so at Card Square."
msgstr "Поздравляю с завершением турнира! Итоговый рейтинг можно посмотреть на Площади карт."

#. ja: 私は、「トリプルトライアド」の大会開催時に、<br>エントリーなどのお手続きを担当しております。<br>何か、ご質問でしょうか？
#. de: Möchtest du an einem Kartenturnier teilnehmen? Oder dir vielleicht noch einmal etwas über die Turniere erklären lassen?
#. fr: Vous venez pour effectuer une démarche relative à un tourrrnoi de Triple Triade comme une inscription<nbsp>? C'est bien ici que ça se passe, tout à fait<nbsp>! Que puis-je faire pour vous<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_200_001:1"
msgid "Greetings, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>! Are you looking to enter a Triple Triad tournament? I would be happy to assist in any way I can!"
msgstr "Здравствуйте, <if $gn4>мисс<else>сэр</if>! Хотите записаться на турнир по тройной триаде? Я с радостью вам помогу!"

#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du?
#. fr: Sur quoi vous renseignez-vous<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_Q4_000_001:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что будете делать?"

#. ja: 次回の大会について聞く
#. de: Nach dem nächsten Turnier fragen.
#. fr: Le prochain tournoi
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A4_000_001:1"
msgid "Ask about the upcoming tournament."
msgstr "Спросить о следующем турнире"

#. ja: 大会について説明を聞く
#. de: Mir die Turniere erklären lassen.
#. fr: Les tournois en général
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A4_000_002:1"
msgid "Ask about tournament rules."
msgstr "Спросить о правилах турниров"

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_A4_000_003:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Ничего."

#. ja: 次回の開催は、「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>」です。<br>目玉賞品は、「<sheet Item $n1 0>」ですよ！<br>たっぷりと腕を磨いてお待ちくださいね！
#. de: Als Nächstes findet das Turnier „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>“ statt. Zu gewinnen gibt es <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1>. Ich würde mich freuen, dich als Teilnehmer<if $gn4>in</if> begrüßen zu dürfen.
#. fr: Le prochain tournoi prévu est <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>, avec <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> pour rrrécompense<nbsp>! Entraînez-vous bien comme il faut avant de vous jeter dans l'arène<nbsp>!
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_TTCUP_210_001:1"
msgid "Our next Triple Triad tournament will be <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>! Only the best players will earn themselves <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>, so have your strongest decks ready!"
msgstr "Следующий турнир по тройной триаде — «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n2 0>»! <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> достанется лишь лучшим, так что приготовьте самые сильные колоды!"

#. ja: 次回「<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>」の開催期間は、<br>（地球時間）<set-time $n2><num $year>年<num $month>月<num $day>日（<switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>） <if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時から、<br><set-time $n3><num $year>年<num $month>月<num $day>日（<switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>） <if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時までです。
#. de: Das nächste Turnier ist „<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>“ und findet vom <set-time $n2><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> (<switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch>) um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr bis zum <set-time $n3><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> (<switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch>) um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr statt.
#. fr: Le prochain tournoi, <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>, se déroulera du <set-time $n2><switch $weekday><case>dimanche<case>lundi<case>mardi<case>mercredi<case>jeudi<case>vendredi<case>samedi</switch> <num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h au <set-time $n3><switch $weekday><case>dimanche<case>lundi<case>mardi<case>mercredi<case>jeudi<case>vendredi<case>samedi</switch> <num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).
#. macro: <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = TripleTriadCompetition, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <set-time $n2> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 77 == 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $day> — a number; value = day of the month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = day of the week of the set time, 1 for Sunday (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <set-time $n3> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscTripleTriadCup_00247:TEXT_CMNGSCTRIPLETRIADCUP_00247_SYSTEM_210_002:1"
msgid "Entries for <sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0> will be accepted from <set-time $n2><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> - <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (<switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch>) to <set-time $n3><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> - <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (<switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch>)."
msgstr "Запись на турнир «<sheet TripleTriadCompetition $n1 0>» открыта с <set-time $n2><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year></if>, <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>PM<else>AM</if> (<switch $weekday><case>воскресенье<case>понедельник<case>вторник<case>среда<case>четверг<case>пятница<case>суббота</switch>) до <set-time $n3><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year></if>, <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>PM<else>AM</if> (<switch $weekday><case>воскресенье<case>понедельник<case>вторник<case>среда<case>четверг<case>пятница<case>суббота</switch>)."
